    "biography": {
      "concept": "Host who speaks for the Wendigo at the Long Table, off Fixit Farm (Act 2)",
      "notes": "The Maître-D' speaks for the Wendigo, the politest monsters in the world, who set a long table where the leylines knot off Furrier's Fixit Farm with a hand-lettered name-card for everyone the region forgot, and one for you. The Maître-D' has a host's manners exactly and nothing else: no small talk, ever; every sentence is a seating, a thanks, a direction or a course. The Wendigo hand back things you never dropped and thank you for directions you never gave. Not threatening. Thorough."
    }
